      openingText: "Beneath you, the world yawns away into endless clouds, pierced only by the glinting tips of mountains forgotten by those who now walk the skies. The bridges sway gently, woven from magic and stone, humming underfoot with old, living energy. Above, spires spiral upward, each one crowned with terraces of hanging gardens and fountains that pour rivers into the air itself. Wind carries distant music — choirs of unseen voices rising in praise or mourning. You have been born into a kingdom where gravity is a choice, and ambition can reach the stars."
