      openingText: "The stone of the statue is weathered, but still magnificent — robes carved into flowing rivers, a crown of flame encircling an unseen brow. Birds nest in its outstretched hands, and entire villages huddle in the shadow of its knees. At the base of the pedestal, ancient glyphs flicker weakly, recounting tales of continents raised and oceans sundered. As you rise, the eyes of the villagers fall upon you — some in hope, some in fear — as if your arrival beneath the Ascendant’s gaze is more prophecy fulfilled than accident."
    },
    {
