      entry: "You awoke adrift among the abandoned temples that once floated high above kingdoms now lost to dust and silence.",
      openingText: "The ground beneath you is a mosaic of shattered blue and gold tiles, glistening with morning dew. Great temples drift silently nearby, their spires cracked and overgrown with flowering vines that glitter under a pale sun. Birds weave lazy spirals through the broken archways. Once, these sanctuaries housed the voice of the gods; now, they whisper only to the wind. Somewhere in the distance, a bell rings once, soft and clear — a call that no one but you seems left to answer."
    },
    {
