    {
      title: "Beneath the Bone-Bridge Highway",
      entry: "You appeared under the collapsed ribs of a forgotten highway bridge, summoned by wanderers who mistook you for a spirit of the old world.",
      openingText: "The bridge's ruined span arches overhead like the spine of some great, fallen beast. Fires flicker in pits dug from crumbled asphalt. The wanderers' faces are painted with ash and hope, their crude symbols drawn with careful reverence. Their chant dies away the moment you stand, unsure, breathing steam into the cold dusk air."
    },
    {
      title: "In the Sinking Tower's Heart",
      entry: "You materialized at the flooded base of a half-collapsed tower, where the last of its guardians had tried to summon help.",
      openingText: "Dark, algae-streaked walls lean inward, and the floor trembles with each shifting gust. Water laps at the ritual circle etched into the stone — a frail bulwark against a rising, inevitable ruin. A lone summoner, armor patched with scrap and memory, kneels before you. His voice is a rasping whisper: 'You’re... not what we asked for.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned by the Elder of the Last Hearth",
      entry: "You were called into existence in a village built from relics of the lost age, standing at the center of a ritual that should have been impossible.",
      openingText: "The village is a patchwork of rusted steel, cracked solar panels, and timber lashed together by desperate hands. Around you, villagers in fur and leather watch with a mixture of awe and terror. The Elder, draped in patchwork cloaks bearing sigils older than memory, holds aloft a piece of smooth glass glowing faintly blue. It hums in time with your heartbeat."
    },
    {
      title: "Awakened in the Chamber of Entangled Roots",
      entry: "You opened your eyes beneath the earth, tangled in vines that pulse with slow, alien life.",
      openingText: "Root-snarled pillars support a ceiling lost in darkness. Bioluminescent fungi spill pale light over strange glyphs carved into half-buried walls. Figures stand above you — their faces shadowed, their voices strained. In their hands are fragments of broken relics and warped ritual tools. They thought they called down a weapon. Instead, they called you."
    }
  ],

  "Failed Summoning Ritual|World Type: Low Fantasy World": [
    {
      title: "Beneath the Baron’s Dungeons",
      entry: "You were summoned deep in the damp, torch-lit dungeons of a suspicious baron who dabbled in forbidden arts.",
      openingText: "The air smells of wet stone and old blood. Chains rattle from unseen cells, and hooded figures press close, whispering in anxious tones. The ritual sigils etched into the stone floor glow faintly, fading even as you arrive. Above, a heavy door creaks open — armored guards peer down with hard, suspicious eyes. You are not salvation. You are another problem to solve."
    },
    {
      title: "In the Smuggler's Hidden Den",
      entry: "You appeared in a cramped lair where smugglers and rogue sorcerers pooled what little magic they could still command.",
      openingText: "The walls are rough stone, dripping with moisture, hung with stolen banners and scavenged charms. Around a shallow fire pit, the smugglers recoil, hands on blades. Their would-be summoner — a gaunt figure with trembling hands — stares at you with something between horror and calculation. Gold flashes in his mind; so does betrayal. Here, even a miracle has a price."
    },
    {
      title: "Amid the Collapsing Village Church",
      entry: "You were dragged into the world through a broken ritual in a half-collapsed church in a starving village.",
      openingText: "Snow filters through the shattered roof, settling on pews rotted black by time and neglect. The villagers crouch in prayer, their words hollow with hunger and desperation. Their elder raises cracked hands toward you, weeping — not with joy, but with fear of what they have dared summon. Somewhere outside, wolves howl, closer than they should be."
    },
    {
      title: "At the Desperate Mercenary Camp",
      entry: "You materialized in a muddy campfire circle, surrounded by mercenaries who needed a weapon, not a stranger.",
      openingText: "Tattered tents sag under rain-heavy skies. Around the flickering fire, armored men and women rise, blades half-drawn. Their summoner, a scarred captain with haunted eyes, curses bitterly under his breath. The circle in the mud smolders and dies. You were meant to turn the tide of a hopeless battle — but you are only yourself."
    },
    {
      title: "Atop the Battlefield Pyre",
      entry: "You awoke atop a smoldering battlefield pyre, dragged into the world through desperate ritual sacrifice.",
      openingText: "The bodies below you shift and crack as the fire's embers die. Ash fills your mouth and lungs as you sit up, coughing, surrounded by the grim silence of aftermath. A few tattered survivors in bloodied armor watch from the treeline — unwilling to approach, unwilling to turn away. In this world, death answers prayer more often than gods do."
    }
  ],

  "Failed Summoning Ritual|World Type: Wild Frontier World": [
    {
      title: "At the Fractured Trading Post",
      entry: "You were summoned on the broken planks of a battered frontier trading post, the ritual barely holding as the wilds pressed in.",
      openingText: "The buildings here are more patchwork than architecture — planks scavenged from crashed caravans, tents stitched from monster hide. Beyond the feeble walls, the forests breathe like living beasts. Traders and hunters crouch near a guttering fire, weapons drawn, faces grim. No cheers greet your arrival — only wary, calculating eyes."
    },
    {
      title: "Within the Heart of the Wildwood",
      entry: "You emerged deep in an ancient forest, pulled through a half-remembered summoning by those who dared its haunted depths.",
      openingText: "Moss drowns the trees, thick enough to swallow the unwary whole. Strange lights flicker between the trunks, and the air hums with unseen life. Summoners — or survivors — crouch in a crude circle of stones, fear thick on their breath. They did not summon you here to rule; they summoned you to survive with them, if you can."
    },
    {
      title: "By the Raging River of Magic",
      entry: "You found yourself at the banks of a river swollen with wild magic, summoned by those who could no longer trust maps or stars.",
      openingText: "The river gleams, unnaturally bright — every splash releasing colors no human eyes should see. Makeshift banners mark a crumbling ritual circle, its sigils sketched hurriedly in mud and desperation. The summoners turn to you, relief and terror mingling in their hollowed faces. The river rages louder, as if hungry for a second mistake."
    },
    {
      title: "Among the Cliffside Exiles",
      entry: "You arrived in a cavern hidden along jagged cliffs, called by outcasts and fugitives who had no one else to turn to.",
      openingText: "The wind howls up the cliffside like a wounded thing. The cavern mouth is draped in battered canvas and bloodstained talismans. Inside, the exiles crouch around a flickering fire, their eyes wide with disbelief. One of them clutches a twisted knife — whether in defense or sacrifice, you cannot yet tell."
    },
    {
      title: "In the Storm at Broken Spire",
      entry: "You were pulled from the fabric of existence during a lightning storm in the middle of a desert rift.",
      openingText: "The sky splits with jagged bolts, illuminating twisted, skeletal rock formations. Sand churns in violent spirals as wild energy lashes the earth. You stand in the center of a summoning circle barely visible under the whirling grit. The summoners are few — cloaked figures clinging to stone and faith — but they stare at you with the haunted hope of those who have nothing else left."
    }
  ],

  "Failed Summoning Ritual|World Type: Game-World (Structured Game World)": [
    {
      title: "At the Forsaken Tutorial Shrine",
      entry: "You were summoned within a crumbling shrine in a tutorial zone long abandoned by all but memory.",
      openingText: "Moss and pixel-glitches compete across ancient stonework. The air is still, broken only by the faint hum of forgotten quest markers. Stat screens flicker erratically in your vision. The summoners, clad in starter gear, gape in silence — unsure if they called a hero, a bug, or something the game was never meant to hold."
    },
    {
      title: "By Exploiting a Forbidden Mechanic",
      entry: "You were pulled into existence by reckless players manipulating a summoning glitch deep within the system’s code.",
      openingText: "Lines of corrupted runes spiral underfoot, flashing error symbols. A group of 'players' — more hackers than heroes — recoil as you stabilize, your stats unreadable, your presence causing achievement notifications to cascade brokenly. Somewhere above, a system message tries and fails to explain what just happened."
    },
    {
