      openingText: "Quest boards flicker in and out of existence. Villagers loop identical greetings endlessly. The summoning circle pulses with unstable textures, warping your shadow. Summoners — partly coded, partly real — stare at you, unsure whether they succeeded or doomed themselves to a world without save points."
    },
    {
      title: "Inside the Broken Dungeon Core",
