      openingText: "The floor tilts unnaturally, as terrain generation struggles to resolve. Ghostly mobs flicker, half-rendered, half-erased. Glyphs meant for bosses spiral across broken pillars. A ragged group of would-be summoners huddle around a dying portal frame, their wide-eyed hope slowly giving way to creeping dread."
    },
    {
