      openingText: "The roaring crowd glitches into silence as you stumble forward into the sand. Opponents — towering, stat-boosted gladiators — hesitate, confused. The summoners' hasty ritual burns in the ground behind you, its afterimages still scrolling error messages. In the silence before combat resumes, only one truth is clear: you are not supposed to be here."
    }
  ],

  "Failed Summoning Ritual|World Type: Game-World (Game Turned Reality)": [
    {
      title: "At the Shattered Respawn Shrine",
      entry: "You were summoned into a crumbling respawn shrine, the code holding it together eroded beyond recognition.",
      openingText: "Stone pillars flicker between textures — marble, obsidian, blank placeholders. Resurrection glyphs spiral uselessly into the cracked ground. Figures — former players or former code — circle you, their health bars glitched and unreadable. The shrine hums mournfully, as if aware it can no longer serve its purpose."
    },
    {
      title: "Among the Sentient Fragments",
      entry: "You were summoned by ex-NPCs whose half-remembered scripts drove them to seek a 'hero' after the world fell apart.",
      openingText: "The summoners bow awkwardly, their animations broken, faces stitched with fear and half-formed joy. Dialog boxes spawn and die around them like dying fireflies. Above, the sky loops in broken frames. They called a champion from shattered dreams — but what they received was you."
    },
    {
      title: "Ripped from the Corrupted Chest",
