      openingText: "The shattered questline scrolls hang overhead, frozen mid-animation. Landmarks spawn and despawn with each breath. Summoners huddle near broken waypoints, the names of former gods flickering on crumbling statuary. You are born into a story long since lost, stitched from fragments and forgotten griefs."
    },
    {
