      openingText: "The sun glitches and falls from the sky. Gravity falters, dragging stones, trees, and bodies upward into the void. In the center of a ruptured city square, summoners in patched-up armor scream and cast fraying spells — not at enemies, but at reality itself. Your arrival feels like the world cracking wider — a wedge driven into its dying heart."
    }
  ],

  "Failed Summoning Ritual|World Type: Endless Winter World": [
    {
      title: "Within the Ice-Locked Monastery",
      entry: "You were summoned in the last standing hall of an ancient monastery entombed in glacial ice.",
      openingText: "Candles flicker weakly in the frigid air, their flames blue and starving. Cloaked figures cluster around a cracked summoning circle traced with frozen blood. The air itself resists you, thick and biting. As you rise, you hear a chorus of cracking stone — the world protesting your arrival as another impossible burden to bear."
    },
    {
      title: "Amid the Blizzard at Broken Keep",
      entry: "You appeared during a whiteout storm within the skeletal ruins of a fortress once proud, now hollowed by endless winters.",
      openingText: "The blizzard screams against stone and soul alike, tearing at broken walls and shattered banners. Summoners kneel atop the frost-rimed battlements, their incantations ripped away by the howling wind. Your form emerges from the blinding white, half-seen, half-hoped — a figure the storm itself seems reluctant to release."
    },
    {
      title: "Under the Pale Starless Sky",
      entry: "You were pulled into the world beneath a sky that has forgotten the sun, at a hunter’s camp on the edge of starvation.",
      openingText: "Frost crunches underfoot, brittle and treacherous. Around a dwindling fire, gaunt hunters lower their heads in reverence or despair. The ritual was their last gamble, and the sky above hangs heavy, mute witness to their failure or triumph. In the silence, you hear the world breathe shallowly, already forgetting warmth."
    },
