    }
  ],

  "Failed Summoning Ritual|World Type: Twilight World": [
    {
      title: "Within the Library of Forgotten Kings",
      entry: "You appeared amid dust and shadow in a grand library where the names of heroes crumble alongside the stones.",
      openingText: "Shelves stretch into darkness, their scrolls brittle, their bindings rotted. Summoners in faded ceremonial garb kneel in the ruin, whispering names no longer remembered. Their ritual flickers like a dying flame. When you step into being, a breeze stirs the silence — not with hope, but the mournful sigh of a world remembering what it is losing."
    },
    {
      title: "At the Shrine of Sinking Sands",
      entry: "You materialized beside a shrine slowly devoured by the desert's patient hunger.",
      openingText: "The sands shift endlessly, swallowing stone, bone, and memory. The summoners stand waist-deep in the dune's grasp, their voices lost to the wind. Etchings on the shrine's worn surface glow faintly as you emerge, a momentary beacon against the slow erasure. Above, the sun hangs low and pale, struggling to touch the world it once loved."
    },
    {
