      openingText: "Broken lenses and shattered mirrors litter the ground. The sky overhead flickers with gaps where constellations should be. The summoners huddle against the cold, clutching maps whose lines no longer connect. They summoned you hoping to glimpse a future — but you can feel the brittle fracture of their hopes before they even speak."
    },
