    openingText: "You awaken to a shriek of failing magic and the cold rush of open air. The stone beneath you lists and groans — an ancient spire suspended above the clouds, fracturing under forces meant for gods. Stained glass windows burst outward in a rain of color and light. Robed summoners scatter, some falling, some frozen in spellshock. The sky is too close. The stars recoil. And as the circle beneath you crumbles, the world below yawns wide — waiting to receive something it no longer understands."
  },
