      openingText: "Braziers of silver fire line the endless hall, casting long, solemn shadows. A colossal figure in battered armor watches you, his expression unreadable. 'Perhaps you will endure,' he says, voice like distant thunder. 'Perhaps you will not.' Without waiting for an answer, he points his great sword at the empty horizon — and the world shatters, casting you headlong into it."
    },
