      openingText: "A chill mist clings to the marble steps, coiling around your ankles. Above, on the throne's distant heights, a formless figure lifts one hand — neither welcome nor warning, only inevitability. The mist thickens, swallowing the pillars, the stairs, and finally you, as unseen currents bear you into the waking world beyond."
    },
