      title: "Spilling into the Fortress-Town",
      entry: "You collapsed against the frozen gates of a frontier stronghold.",
      openingText: "Guards peer down from walls thick with ice, crossbows trained without pity. Banners snap in a wind sharp enough to flay. Behind the gates, you glimpse grim markets lit by guttering blue torches. Survival here has no room for the weak — or the strange."
    },
