      title: "Landing Before the Hearthfire Shrine",
      entry: "You collapsed before a circle of stones blackened with old flame.",
      openingText: "Pilgrims huddle around guttering fires, faces hollow, hands raw. Ash drifts in the wind like falling stars. They whisper prayers into the frozen earth — not for riches, not for power, but simply for another spring that may never come again."
    }
  ],

  "Mirror Crossing|World Type: Twilight World": [
