      title: "Greeted by the Hollow Prince",
      entry: "You emerged in a court of rotting banners and silent courtiers.",
      openingText: "The last shreds of golden light fade into a chamber draped in decay. Upon a crumbling throne, a young man in blackened armor lifts hollow eyes to you. 'Another guest,' he says, voice like cracked bells. 'Another player in a game whose rules no longer matter.' Around him, empty-eyed nobles bow mockingly."
    },
    {
      title: "Met by the Bonewright of the Wastes",
      entry: "You landed amidst an ossuary field, where a bone-armored figure waited.",
      openingText: "The storm leaves you gasping among hills of skulls and broken dreams. A hunched figure looms above, crafting a sigil from femurs and rune-etched bone. Without looking up, it growls, 'You wear no sigil yet. Good. It means you are still worth breaking... or building.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned by the Nameless Court",
      entry: "You found yourself before a black dais where cowled judges watched silently.",
      openingText: "Shadow coils like smoke around you. Five cowled figures sit unmoving, their faces hidden, their decrees etched into the very stones. One raises a skeletal hand. 'By the Invitation of the Forsaken Charter, you stand summoned. Your choices will judge you. Your blood will bind you.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Welcomed at the Broken Gate",
      entry: "You stumbled onto shattered steps where a grim-faced woman waited with shackles in hand.",
      openingText: "The world sharpens into sharp stone and colder glances. The woman says nothing at first, only studying you with weary, pitiless eyes. Finally, she tosses the shackles at your feet. 'Welcome,' she says. 'Your chains or your sword — choose one. Quickly.'"
    }
  ],

  "Invitation by Letter|World Type: High Fantasy World": [
    {
      title: "Welcomed by the Archon of the Sky Court",
      entry: "You emerged on a platform of crystal high above glittering kingdoms.",
      openingText: "The feathers settle into shimmering motes. A being of radiant wings and mirrored armor approaches, every step ringing like a song. 'Chosen of distant dreams,' the Archon intones, 'you are called not by fate alone, but by design. Kneel — and ascend.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Greeted by the Magister of the First Academy",
      entry: "You arrived in a golden hall where sorcerers and sages whispered behind luminous veils.",
      openingText: "Magic thrums under your feet as you stagger to stand. A robed elder adorned in constellations approaches, his staff humming with unseen energies. 'The Invitation found you through time and tide,' he says, voice rich with ancient power. 'We shall see if your spirit is worthy of the First Arts.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Met by the Emissary of the Sunborne Throne",
      entry: "You stumbled into a radiant courtyard where banners of burning light unfurled.",
      openingText: "Sunlight sharper than any blade cuts across marble towers. A knight cloaked in fire-kissed silk offers a gloved hand. 'Rise, bearer of distant hopes,' she says, eyes fierce. 'The Sunborne Throne does not call lightly — nor does it forgive easily.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned to the Verdant Spire",
      entry: "You landed amidst a living tower of vines and blossoms where druids watched.",
      openingText: "The air is heavy with magic so dense it tastes sweet. An elder druid, her hair woven with singing leaves, steps forward. 'The Spire grows restless,' she murmurs. 'It called for a seed — and you answered. Let us see if you can root yourself in this world.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Welcomed by the Starborn Oracle",
      entry: "You found yourself in a temple under a sky of shifting galaxies.",
      openingText: "A thousand stars swirl above, close enough to touch. Upon a dais of polished nightstone, a figure in robes of woven constellations kneels. 'You are written on no scroll,' she whispers, voice trembling with awe. 'Yet you have come. This will change everything.'"
    }
  ],

  "Invitation by Letter|World Type: Low Fantasy World": [
    {
      title: "Welcomed by the King's Tattered Envoy",
      entry: "You arrived at the muddy outskirts of a broken castle where a weary envoy waited.",
      openingText: "The last of the golden feathers falls into a puddle of blackened rainwater. A man wrapped in threadbare royal colors steps forward, glancing over his shoulder as if already hunted. 'You got the letter,' he says without warmth. 'Means you're either desperate or stupid. Pray it’s the former — the king needs fools who still dream.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Greeted by the Hedge Witch of the Borderlands",
      entry: "You stumbled into a crooked hut perched on a storm-blasted cliff.",
      openingText: "The door swings open on a snarl of wind. Inside, a wiry woman hunched over a smoky cauldron peers at you with one sharp eye. 'Another one dragged in by old tricks,' she cackles. 'Fine. Sit. Drink. Not much left to save in this land — but maybe you’ll manage a miracle before you rot.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Met by the Captain of Broken Banners",
      entry: "You emerged amid a ruined battlefield where a scarred captain awaited.",
      openingText: "Crows scatter as you stagger upright. Tattered flags whip in the cold air. A woman in dented armor leans on a broken spear, eyeing you with grim appraisal. 'Invitation or no, you’ll earn your place in blood,' she says. 'If you last the night, maybe we’ll bother asking your name.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned to the Dustmarket’s Edge",
      entry: "You found yourself in a decaying bazaar where traders hawked broken dreams.",
      openingText: "The smell of rust, sweat, and cheap incense clogs the air. A sharp-eyed merchant approaches, letter in hand, weighing you like spoiled meat. 'Brought in by that damned parchment, eh?' he mutters. 'Plenty like you pass through. Most end up in ditches. Maybe you’ll be different. Maybe.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Welcomed at the Blackwater Chapel",
      entry: "You stumbled into a ruined church where a silent priestess waited among empty pews.",
      openingText: "Candles gutter in the damp chill. The priestess rises from prayer, her face a blank mask of resignation. She offers no words — only a small iron token pressed into your hand. Etched into its surface is a single word: *Survive.*"
    }
  ],

  "Invitation by Letter|World Type: Wild Frontier World": [
    {
      title: "Welcomed by the Pathwarden",
      entry: "You stumbled into a weathered campfire where a ranger waited, sharpening a blade.",
      openingText: "As the last gold feathers drift away, you find yourself under endless stars, the trees whispering secrets around you. A ranger looks up from the fire, eyes hard but not unkind. 'You're late,' he says, tossing another branch onto the flame. 'The wilds don’t wait for dreamers. If you’re coming, you’d best be quick on your feet.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Greeted by the Riverfolk Elder",
      entry: "You arrived at a stilted village swaying gently above a misty river.",
      openingText: "The portal fades into the scent of wet earth and woodsmoke. An elder leans against a twisted cane, river water dripping from his boots. 'The currents have carried stranger things than you,' he says, voice deep as the river. 'But few who cross return unchanged. Best learn to swim, soul and all.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Met by the Lone Cartographer",
      entry: "You emerged onto a crag where a mapmaker traced forgotten paths into the dirt.",
      openingText: "The world comes back sharp — stone beneath you, vast valleys below. A woman crouches, sketching wild lines into the dust. She glances up, a crooked smile tugging her lips. 'Another fool scribbled onto the map,' she says. 'Good. We could use more mad ones out here.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned to the Thornbloom Hollow",
      entry: "You found yourself at the heart of a hidden glade, where thorned vines wove a living shrine.",
      openingText: "Moonlight filters through twisted trees, casting silver webs on the ground. At the center, a robed figure kneels among blooming thorns, hands stained with sap and blood. 'By root and song,' they murmur, 'the wilds have claimed you. May you prove worth the thorn’s mercy.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Welcomed at the Crooked Stone Cairns",
      entry: "You stumbled into an ancient field of leaning stones where a shaman waited.",
      openingText: "The wind sings through gaps in towering stones, each worn by forgotten hands. An old shaman watches from atop a cairn, bones and beads clattering at her belt. 'The land remembers the old pacts,' she says, voice thin but sure. 'You will, too, before this place forgets your name.'"
    }
  ],

  "Invitation by Letter|World Type: Game-World (Structured Game World)": [
    {
      title: "Welcomed by the Master of Initiates",
      entry: "You arrived in a marble plaza where holographic banners listed quests.",
      openingText: "The golden feathers fade into structured light: banners flicker overhead, listing new objectives in shimmering glyphs. A woman clad in angular armor approaches, clipboard in hand. 'Unit identified: New Arrival,' she says briskly. 'Welcome to Tier One Initiation. Survival rate: 42%. Orientation begins now.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Greeted by the System Architect’s Proxy",
      entry: "You stumbled into a sterile white hall where a glowing figure waited.",
      openingText: "You blink into brightness — walls hum with soft, mechanical heartbeats. A figure of shifting pixels approaches, face ever-changing. 'Welcome, beta asset,' it intones. 'The System accepts your entry. Your parameters will be tested shortly.' The air shivers with unseen code."
    },
    {
      title: "Met by the Quest Registrar",
      entry: "You found yourself at a bustling quest hub populated by NPCs and adventurers.",
      openingText: "Laughter and clinking armor echo through the square. A squat man behind a massive desk waves a ledger thick with tasks. 'Fresh blood, eh?' he crows. 'Good, good — got monsters need killin’, relics need fetchin’, kingdoms need fixin’. Sign here — or rot.' His grin gleams with too many teeth."
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned to the Guild of Seekers",
      entry: "You emerged before a towering guildhall where banners showed faction emblems.",
      openingText: "The grand doors swing open as you stumble forward. A chorus of cheers and jeers greets you — warriors, mages, rogues crowding the hall. A robed guildmaster approaches, a golden badge extended. 'You were called,' she says simply. 'Now prove you deserve to stay.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Welcomed at the Forgotten Patch"
      ,entry: "You stumbled into a glitching landscape where half-rendered ruins hung in midair.",
      openingText: "Reality stutters around you: trees half-formed, roads vanishing midstride. A lone programmer wearing a cracked VR headset sits cross-legged on a frozen hill. 'Not supposed to be anyone here yet,' he mutters. 'Guess the old invites still work. Careful where you step — the ground remembers bugs.'"
    }
  ],

  "Invitation by Letter|World Type: Game-World (Game Turned Reality)": [
    {
      title: "Welcomed by the Glitched Envoy",
      entry: "You materialized in a fractured plaza where geometry bent unnaturally.",
      openingText: "The golden portal spits you into broken streets — angles wrong, sky flickering. A figure stitched from broken quest icons limps toward you. 'Invitation error,' it croaks. 'Reassigned to Instance Zero. Good luck... if variables hold.' Then it shudders apart into data shards."
    },
    {
      title: "Greeted by the Warden of Lost Players",
      entry: "You found yourself in a cracked hubworld where abandoned gear littered the ground.",
      openingText: "Rust-red banners sag from leaning towers. A woman clad in scavenged gear raises a battered sword in greeting. 'Welcome to what’s left,' she says grimly. 'The gods are gone, the scripts broken. If you want to live, make your own quest — and fast.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Met by the Last Devout",
      entry: "You stumbled into a crumbling cathedral coded in broken glyphs.",
      openingText: "Code drips like rain from the shattered ceiling. At the altar, a robed figure mutters prayers in patch notes. They lift their head, hollow-eyed. 'You were written... and forgotten. We serve the Last Update now. Whatever it brings.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned to the Arena of Null",
      entry: "You emerged onto cracked tiles stained with old battle echoes.",
      openingText: "Spectral crowds cheer — then flicker and vanish. You stand alone in a vast arena under glitching stars. A mechanical voice blares from nowhere: 'NEW CONTESTANT ACCEPTED. SURVIVAL TEST INITIATED.' A countdown ticks somewhere deep in your bones."
    },
    {
      title: "Welcomed at the Rusted Gate",
      entry: "You stumbled through a portal into a frontier between broken code and wild magic.",
      openingText: "The land shivers under mismatched weather patterns. A hooded figure stands by the rusted gate, a crude map etched onto an old server rack. 'Dead code's behind you,' they say. 'Living madness ahead. Pick your poison, traveler.'"
    }
  ],

  "Invitation by Letter|World Type: Endless Winter World": [
    {
      title: "Welcomed by the Frostwarden",
      entry: "You stumbled into a frozen watchtower where a cloaked figure waited, lantern in hand.",
      openingText: "The last feathers freeze midair, falling as crystals. A figure wrapped in tattered furs lifts a lantern against the endless night. 'The storm heard your name,' he rasps, breath misting. 'You crossed into the cold willingly. That makes you either brave — or doomed.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Greeted by the Hearthmistress",
      entry: "You arrived in a tiny settlement huddled around a single, defiant flame.",
      openingText: "The portal spits you into biting wind and darkened woods. A heavyset woman stands at the village gate, arms folded. 'Another fool chasing ghosts,' she grunts. 'Well, if your blood runs hot enough, you might live to regret it. Get inside before the night chews your bones.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Met by the Last Winter Knight",
      entry: "You stumbled onto a frost-cracked road where a lone knight awaited, armor rimed with ice.",
      openingText: "The path crunches beneath your boots as a figure in frozen plate rises to meet you. 'Another to bear the mark of the Pale King,' he says grimly. 'Or maybe just another meal for the drifts. We’ll see soon enough.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned to the Snowblind Archive",
      entry: "You found yourself within a crumbling, half-buried library lit by guttering candles.",
      openingText: "Snow fills the shattered halls, covering shelves of forgotten wisdom. A hunched archivist, wrapped in patchwork furs, greets you with hollow laughter. 'They said we'd call no more souls,' she rasps. 'But here you are. Another story desperate enough to survive the freeze.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Welcomed at the Silent Monolith",
      entry: "You stumbled across a massive black obelisk jutting from the endless ice fields.",
      openingText: "The cold bites deeper than thought. An old man in gray furs stands by the base of the monolith, hand pressed to its surface. 'It called you too, didn’t it?' he says without turning. 'If you listen close, you’ll hear it whisper... promises you won't like.'"
    }
  ],

  "Invitation by Letter|World Type: Twilight World": [
    {
      title: "Welcomed by the Last Archivist",
      entry: "You stumbled into a dust-choked hall where the air hung thick with forgotten names.",
      openingText: "Feathers turn to dust as they land at your feet. A robed woman seated by a broken ledger looks up, ancient sadness etched deep. 'Another who has not yet learned how endings taste,' she murmurs. 'Come, then. Add your name before it, too, fades.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Greeted by the Twilight Steward",
      entry: "You found yourself at a crumbling observatory perched on the world's edge.",
      openingText: "The portal closes behind you with a sigh. An old man adjusts a rusted telescope, barely sparing you a glance. 'You're late,' he mutters. 'The last star dies soon. We need witnesses... even if none will remember.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Met by the Candlebearer",
      entry: "You arrived at a crossroads lined with guttering lanterns barely holding back the night.",
      openingText: "The light trembles as you step forward. A hunched figure tends to the last surviving lanterns, muttering prayers to forgotten gods. 'Another soul to walk the ashes,' she says without looking up. 'Carry your flame carefully, little one. The dark is very, very hungry.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned to the Withered Court",
      entry: "You stumbled into a fallen throne room where ghostly courtiers waited in silence.",
      openingText: "The walls sag under the weight of old banners. Pale figures in tattered finery bow as you approach. Upon a shattered throne, an empty crown gleams. A voice — yours, yet not — whispers: *Remember what we were.*"
    },
    {
      title: "Welcomed at the Silent Shore",
      entry: "You found yourself by a vast, unmoving sea where the stars fell one by one into the waves.",
      openingText: "The tide pulls softly at your feet. A woman dressed in mourning robes watches the dying heavens. 'Every soul drifts here, in time,' she says. 'You are early — or perhaps very, very late.' She gestures to the empty sea. 'Choose a direction, and lose yourself.'"
    }
  ],

  "Sacrificial Mistake|World Type: Regular Another World Fantasy": [
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Village Warding Circle",
      entry: "You stumbled into a mist-wrapped clearing where farmers froze in terror around a glowing ward.",
      openingText: "The fog coils around your ankles as you blink back the dizziness. Villagers clad in humble homespun garb stare at you, pale with fear. Their protective circle — meant to repel monsters — now hums wildly, flickering in disarray. An elder stammers, 'You... you were not the spirit we called... gods forgive us.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned by the Hedge-Witch's Commune",
      entry: "You arrived inside a moss-covered grove where a half-dozen witches clutched broken talismans.",
      openingText: "The scent of crushed herbs fills your lungs. Around you, women in patchwork robes mutter frantic prayers, their chalk circles fractured. 'It was meant to be a guardian spirit!' one gasps, wringing her hands. Another glares at you as if it's your fault. 'This... this is very wrong.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Dragged by the Knightly Order’s Rite",
      entry: "You stumbled onto a stone dais where armored knights bowed in confusion.",
      openingText: "Torches gutter in the high, arched hall. Dozens of knights kneel in ceremonial formation — then slowly rise, swords half-drawn. A man in gilded armor stares at you, disbelieving. 'Where is the Sainted Warden?' he demands. 'Who — what — are you?'"
    },
    {
      title: "Pulled by the Harvest Spirits Festival",
      entry: "You emerged among dancers celebrating an old autumn festival.",
      openingText: "Music halts midnote. The costumed dancers back away, dropping colorful wreaths. Children peek from behind hay carts. An elder with a painted mask lowers it slowly. 'The old rites spoke of gifts returned,' she says in a trembling voice. 'But not like this... never like this.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Forest Shrine Keepers",
      entry: "You stumbled into a sacred glen where masked priests shielded a flickering altar.",
      openingText: "The shrine's altar pulses with failing magic. Masked figures clutch ritual staves, their chants broken into panicked murmurs. 'The rite cracked wide,' one priest hisses. 'The spirits... sent something else.' The way they look at you feels more like prayer than welcome."
    }
  ],

  "Sacrificial Mistake|World Type: Post-Post Apocalypse Fantasy": [
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Ashwood Clan",
      entry: "You stumbled into a hollow tree-ring village lit by moss and bone fires.",
      openingText: "The earth hums under your hands as you rise. Tribal figures clad in bark and woven iron stare in shock. Their rune-staves sputter in the gloom. 'The old world... it spoke wrong,' the chieftain mutters. 'This is no spirit of plenty. This is... something else.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned by the Dustbinders",
      entry: "You arrived in a canyon where nomads knelt among shattered relics.",
      openingText: "Ancient skyscrapers tilt broken in the distance. Around you, weathered pilgrims clutch sun-faded banners. 'We asked the Deep Powers for water,' whispers a man draped in solar cloth. 'And they send... a stranger?'"
    },
    {
      title: "Dragged by the Forgotten Kin",
      entry: "You stumbled into a rust-buried temple where ancestral fires flickered low.",
      openingText: "Wind moans through cracked metal ribs overhead. Hooded figures scatter as you land among shattered altars. A robed matron steadies herself against a leaning pillar, voice quavering: 'Not the Child of Renewal... but something far more lost.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Pulled by the Skyvine Tribe",
      entry: "You emerged into a high, misty canopy where skywalkers froze in mid-prayer.",
      openingText: "Tangles of flowering vines catch you, lowering you roughly onto a woven bridge. Warriors clad in feathered capes gape in stunned silence. 'No star-child,' one mutters. 'No sky-blessed. Only... you.' Their disappointment cuts deeper than anger."
    },
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Rootspeakers",
      entry: "You stumbled onto a living altar grown from ancient tech and tangled oak.",
      openingText: "Pulse-lights flicker dimly under the bark as you stagger upright. Druidic figures clutching data-shards watch with wide, fearful eyes. 'It answered,' one breathes. 'But the message... the message is broken.'"
    }
  ],

  "Sacrificial Mistake|World Type: Dark Fantasy World": [
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Bleeding Covenant",
      entry: "You stumbled into a grim circle of blood-masked priests amid a ruined cathedral.",
      openingText: "Blood slicks the stone at your feet. Hooded priests recoil, their rusted knives clattering to the floor. 'The price was not paid in full,' one hisses, trembling. 'The old gods are angered... and they sent this mockery instead.' Their terror cuts sharper than any blade."
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned by the Cult of Pale Chains",
      entry: "You arrived among chained prisoners forced to enact a rite of desperation.",
      openingText: "Broken chains drag at your limbs as you rise. Slaves in tattered rags cower back from the flickering summoning circle. Overseers stare, aghast. 'It is neither beast nor salvation,' one rasps. 'It... should not have come.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Dragged by the Hollow Faithful",
      entry: "You stumbled into a forsaken chapel filled with hollow-eyed zealots.",
      openingText: "The acrid scent of burning bones fills your lungs. Around you, zealots hammer cracked bells, their chants warping into wails. 'No angel,' the eldest weeps, clutching a blackened cross. 'No savior. Just another cursed shadow.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Pulled by the Maw Apostles",
      entry: "You emerged into a pit where starving cultists offered scraps to a monstrous altar.",
      openingText: "Ragged figures fall silent, bread and bone clutched tight. Eyes glitter with sickly hunger. 'We fed the pit our hopes,' croaks the priestess. 'It spits back despair... dressed like a stranger.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Broken Crown Loyalists",
      entry: "You stumbled into the shattered throne room of a usurped, dying kingdom.",
      openingText: "Tattered banners hang limp. Blood pools at your feet. A dying knight lifts his sword weakly toward you. 'The last heir... was supposed to come,' he whispers. 'You... you are not them.' His blade falls with a clatter that sounds like the end of an era."
    }
  ],

  "Sacrificial Mistake|World Type: High Fantasy World": [
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Celestial Conclave",
      entry: "You stumbled into a sky-lit spire where archmages weaved strands of starlight.",
      openingText: "The very air hums with cosmic power. Robed figures clutch glowing sigils, staring at you as if you shattered the constellations themselves. 'The astral gate was meant to summon a scion of prophecy,' one murmurs, voice hollow. 'Not... this.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned by the Silver Court",
      entry: "You arrived in a crystalline hall where nobles spoke spells into being.",
      openingText: "The light of a thousand chandeliers refracts around you. Silk-robed courtiers freeze, golden cups slipping from their fingers. A prince steps forward, horror and calculation in his eyes. 'The ritual chose... a stranger?' His smile twists. 'How... quaint.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Dragged by the High Warden’s Ritual",
      entry: "You stumbled into a marble sanctum where paladins formed sacred circles.",
      openingText: "The floor glows with ancient runes, now sparking and cracking. Armor-clad knights shield their faces from the backlash. 'The Heir of Light was foretold!' the High Warden roars. 'This... interloper is a stain on prophecy!'"
    },
    {
      title: "Pulled by the Verdant Sovereigns",
      entry: "You emerged in a throne room wrapped by a living forest, vines twisting underfoot.",
      openingText: "The trees bow in unnatural silence. Leaf-crowned figures clutch thorn-staves and watch with guarded suspicion. 'The Greenmother sent no such child,' the Queen murmurs. 'The forest has... misdelivered.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Last Aetherian Circle",
      entry: "You stumbled onto a floating isle where elder mages spun the final spell of their age.",
      openingText: "Gravity itself twists uneasily. Elder sorcerers stagger as the spell fractures midair. A woman with hair of woven mist glares down at you. 'We summoned salvation,' she breathes. 'The currents gave us... flotsam.'"
    }
  ],

  "Sacrificial Mistake|World Type: Low Fantasy World": [
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Dagger’s Covenant",
      entry: "You stumbled into a soot-stained cellar where masked conspirators plotted rebellion.",
      openingText: "The air stinks of sweat and smoke. Cloaked figures knock over maps and spilled ale as they recoil from your sudden arrival. A scarred woman hisses, dagger half-drawn. 'Where's the assassin we paid for?' she spits. 'What in the gods’ name is this?'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned by the Silent Monks",
      entry: "You arrived inside a crumbling abbey where wordless monks shaped broken rituals.",
      openingText: "Dust dances in the fractured sunlight. Hooded monks press themselves to the walls, prayer beads forgotten. A single chime sounds once — then falls into eerie silence. You see it in their eyes: they called for an angel. They got you instead."
    },
    {
      title: "Dragged by the Smuggler Kings",
      entry: "You stumbled into a salt-crusted warehouse where smugglers performed a risky pact.",
      openingText: "Barrels crack and scatter as rough men in ragged cloaks leap to their feet, hands at hidden blades. 'That ain't the bounty spirit we paid the witch for!' one snarls. Behind him, something unseen slithers back into the shadows, disappointed."
    },
    {
      title: "Pulled by the Lordless Knights",
      entry: "You emerged in a ruined keep where armored mercenaries lit ritual braziers.",
      openingText: "Flickering firelight casts twisted shadows across shattered banners. A knight with a broken sword regards you warily. 'We swore an oath to serve the Lion Returned,' he says grimly. 'You are not the Lion... are you?'"
    },
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Dustfolk Seers",
      entry: "You stumbled into a wind-choked tent where soothsayers traced omens in sand.",
      openingText: "The seers gasp as your arrival scatters their careful patterns. Torn fabric snaps in the dry wind. 'No chosen heir,' one croaks. 'No savior. Just... a pebble thrown in the storm.' They draw their cloaks tighter, afraid to look at you too long."
    }
  ],

  "Sacrificial Mistake|World Type: Wild Frontier World": [
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Thornwatch Lodge",
      entry: "You stumbled into a hunting lodge mid-ritual, antlered hunters freezing in alarm.",
      openingText: "The great fire crackles as hunters in rough leathers step back, arrows half-loosed. Their shaman fumbles her staff, whispering, 'No spirit of the forest answered. Something else crawled through the gap.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned by the Ridgeborn Clans",
      entry: "You arrived on a snowy plateau where clanspeople drew power from mountain stones.",
      openingText: "The wind scours your skin as hard-eyed warriors stare from behind rune-carved stones. A chieftain drops his hammer in shock. 'We offered blood and stone. You... are neither.' His clan begins to murmur, knives flashing in suspicion."
    },
    {
      title: "Dragged by the Lantern River Tribes",
      entry: "You stumbled onto a misty riverbank where boats glowed with ritual light.",
      openingText: "The river pulls at you with a thousand invisible hands. Tribal shamans wearing shells and feathers shield their children behind them. 'The Lantern Mother's gift,' one murmurs. 'Or her curse. Time will tell.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Pulled by the Broken Banner Outcasts",
      entry: "You emerged in a muddy encampment of exiled wanderers.",
      openingText: "The heavy rain dampens every cry of alarm. Ragged soldiers clutch makeshift weapons. Their leader, an aging woman with a tattered standard, squints at you. 'Another exile, then,' she says grimly. 'Or something worse.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Verdant Sons",
      entry: "You stumbled into an ancient grove where primal rites stirred the roots.",
      openingText: "The trees creak with something like laughter. Druidic figures retreat into the shadowed treeline. 'We called the seedling king,' an old man mutters, thumbing a charm. 'And we were answered... by a weed.'"
    }
  ],

  "Sacrificial Mistake|World Type: Game-World (Structured Game World)": [
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the System Architects",
      entry: "You stumbled into a golden hub-world where admins cast system-wide rituals.",
      openingText: "The world shimmers in pixelated gold and shifting light as you stumble into a domed hall. Hooded figures with admin badges freeze mid-chant. One stares down at a floating, broken UI sigil. 'We called for a Raid Champion,' she mutters. 'The system... glitched.' The others stare at you in horror, uncertain if you are error, anomaly, or some terrible new event."
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned by the Dungeon Makers",
      entry: "You arrived in an under-construction dungeon room buzzing with pixelated scaffolds.",
      openingText: "Blueprints and half-finished monsters flicker around you, half-formed creatures pausing their spawn cycles to gape. Designers in sleek, floating robes exchange panicked glances. 'The summoning node corrupted!' a foreman shouts. 'Pull it back!' But the portal has already collapsed, sealing you inside a dungeon still writing itself."
    },
    {
      title: "Dragged by the Tutorial Council",
      entry: "You stumbled into a glitching, corrupted tutorial town.",
      openingText: "The air smells of burning code. Holographic NPCs glitch between friendly greetings and battle cries. A mentor figure, half-transparent, approaches with a jerky, broken smile. 'You are... welcome, Hero... Error.404NameNotFound.' His eyes flicker. 'Please proceed... to destiny.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Pulled by the Class Diviners",
      entry: "You emerged in a cathedral of floating skill trees and fractured character sheets.",
      openingText: "Menus swirl around your vision, disjointed and unreadable. Ranks of cloaked diviners stagger backward, their data-scrolls sparking with red warnings. 'We sought a God-Tier Ascendant,' one croaks. 'But the script cracked... and delivered something uncoded.' Their fear grows as you simply stand there, undefined by any known role."
    },
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Patchweavers",
      entry: "You stumbled into a server maintenance field as reality shifted under your feet.",
      openingText: "Technomancers weave glowing patches into the fabric of reality itself. You fall onto shifting ground as coding threads whip past. 'You — you're not an update,' gasps one robed technician. His screen fills with ERROR REPORTS. 'The rollback... it's too late.' Around you, reality twitches and stutters, struggling to understand what you even are."
    }
  ],

  "Sacrificial Mistake|World Type: Game-World (Game Turned Reality)": [
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Echoed Guild",
      entry: "You stumbled into a decaying guild hall where abandoned characters enacted old rites.",
      openingText: "Dust drifts through the once-bustling hall, empty quest boards swinging on broken hinges. Avatars frozen in endless idle animations watch blankly as you land with a crash. An ancient NPC priest, half-corrupted, raises a staff glitching between fire and ice. 'The forgotten players prayed for salvation,' he says in a voice that crackles like broken speakers. 'They summoned... a ghost.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned by the Dead Questgivers",
      entry: "You arrived in a hollow city where dead-eyed questgivers repeated broken scripts.",
      openingText: "Neon quest markers flicker over the skeletal ruins of a player capital. Voices endlessly loop: 'Greetings, traveler... Greetings, traveler...' until your presence shorts them out. A cracked hologram, once a grand king, stutters: 'You... you were not the answer written in the code.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Dragged by the Reclaimer Anomalies",
      entry: "You stumbled into a shattered landscape where system anomalies built unstable altars.",
      openingText: "Fragmented terrain juts at impossible angles. Semi-formed mobs and glitched beasts shuffle in ritual circles. A massive anomaly wreathed in static turns slowly toward you, tilting its head. 'Pattern mismatch,' it intones. 'Summoning error logged. Subject: unknown construct.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Pulled by the Forgotten Beta Lords",
      entry: "You emerged atop a crumbling skybridge built by a beta test long abandoned.",
      openingText: "Rain falls sideways across the fragmented sky. Hooded figures in corrupted beta armor kneel before a cracked portal. 'The First Heroes abandoned us,' whispers one. 'We offered prayers in broken packets... and something answered. Something wrong.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Echo-Dwellers",
      entry: "You stumbled into a decayed town looped in endless, broken time.",
      openingText: "Every few minutes, the same market bell tolls, the same bird takes flight, the same man drops his cart. You land amidst it all, an error without script. A woman whose face flickers like a corrupted file clutches your hand. 'Maybe you are... what we needed,' she says, voice split across ten echoes. 'Maybe you're what ends it.'"
    }
  ],

  "Sacrificial Mistake|World Type: Endless Winter World": [
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Frostbound Circle",
      entry: "You stumbled into a snow-crowned altar where shivering priests whispered desperate prayers.",
      openingText: "The wind howls like a living beast, ripping the warmth from your body as you kneel in the snow. Hooded figures garbed in threadbare furs gather around a guttering flame. 'The Ice-Mother was to send her champion,' the eldest rasps, frost clinging to his beard. 'Not... this lost soul.' Behind him, the altar cracks and groans under unseen weight."
    },
    {
      title: "Summoned by the Hearthless Tribes",
      entry: "You arrived in a dying village encased in rime and sorrow.",
      openingText: "Half-buried huts lean against each other for warmth. Children stare with hollow eyes from behind layers of patched fur. An elder bearing a broken amulet approaches, despair plain in his sagging shoulders. 'We begged the Old Winds for a protector,' he says quietly. 'They answered with a question instead.'"
    },
    {
      title: "Dragged by the Glacier Priests",
