    },
    {
      title: "Pulled by the Last Ember Kin",
      entry: "You emerged at the smoldering remnants of a pyre under a midnight sun.",
      openingText: "Ash dances in the frigid air as the last embers die. Nomads huddled in soot-streaked cloaks lift weary faces to see you. A woman with burns down one side of her face whispers, 'We sent the fire into the sky. We prayed for its child. What ash have they given us instead?'"
    },
    {
      title: "Mistaken by the Frostfallen Lords",
      entry: "You stumbled into a frozen court where ancient kings slumber in ice.",
      openingText: "Massive thrones, empty save for ice-shrouded forms, loom around you. A crack races across the glacial floor as you rise. Ghostly figures emerge from the mist, voices cold and brittle. 'The bloodline was broken,' murmurs a crowned shade. 'The call was desperate. The response... a mistake carved in frost.'"
    }
  ],

  "Sacrificial Mistake|World Type: Twilight World": [
    {
