      entry: "You awaken in an empty arena where loading screens flicker faintly across cracked walls.",
      openingText: "The crowd that should have cheered is gone, leaving only the sound of your own breathing. System warnings pulse in the corner of your sight — network lost, opponent missing. You stand alone beneath a broken sky that once promised glory."
